{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:e965af2a898e4eec","name":"Sith Alchemy Talent Tree","source":{"id":"source:reference-e965af2a898e4eec","title":"Sith Alchemy Talent Tree","revision":20530,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T00:01:52Z","sha256":"b58a6bf8f20ea4a7f8ba4307b7693afd29ded374f1f647e3706b3c1505d06441","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20530","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Sith%20Alchemy%20Talent%20Tree&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-e965af2a898e4eec","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Academy Training Manual"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Academy_Training_Manual"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You have learned the alchemical arts of the ancient ",{"tag":"a","children":["Sith Lords"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sith_Lords"}," and can create objects and creatures that are filled with the power of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Dark Side"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Dark_Side"},".\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Core Talents"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Cause Mutation"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Sith Advanced Alchemy"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You can use your mastery of Sith Alchemy to create mutated abominations. You must have access to a willing (or unconscious) creature to which you will apply the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Sith Abomination Template"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sith_Abomination_Template"}," or the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Chrysalis Beast Template"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Chrysalis_Beast_Template"},". You also need a medical lab outfitted for the process, which requires a number of days equal to creature's modified CL. You must spend a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," at the completion of the process to complete the transformation. A creature you have mutated is considered to be a domesticated creature, but for you only (unless it was already a domesticated creature before its mutation).\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Rapid Alchemy"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"},", you can perform minor alchemical alterations to a melee weapon you wield. For the remainder of the encounter, you gain a +2 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Equipment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Equipment","referenceId":"reference:7f2465ac7cefab27"}," bonus on attack rolls with that weapon. Additionally, once before the end of the encounter, you can sacrifice this bonus as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Free Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Free_Action"}," to gain a +5 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Equipment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Equipment","referenceId":"reference:7f2465ac7cefab27"}," bonus on a single damage roll you make with that weapon.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["This section was titled Sith Alchemy in its official source, but has been renamed to distinguish it from the similarly named \"",{"tag":"a","children":["Sith Alchemy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sith_Alchemy"},".\""]}]},"\n"]}]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Sith Advanced Alchemy"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Your knowledge of Sith Alchemy allows you to imbue certain objects with the power of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Dark Side"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Dark_Side"},". You can perform any of the following Alchemical Transformations, though each time you do so, increase your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dark Side Score"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dark_Side_Score"}," by 1.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Create Sith Amulet:"]}," You can create a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Sith Amulet"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sith_Amulet","referenceId":"reference:808a67262773c680"},". The creation of a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Sith Amulet"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sith_Amulet","referenceId":"reference:808a67262773c680"}," requires 25,000 credits' worth of gems and other raw materials, and the creation process takes 1 week (this work can be spread out over several sessions and need not be consecutive). At the end of the process, you must spend a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," to complete the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Sith Amulet"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sith_Amulet","referenceId":"reference:808a67262773c680"},", after which point it functions exactly as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Sith Amulet"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sith_Amulet","referenceId":"reference:808a67262773c680"},"."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Create Sith Armor:"]}," You can transform a suit of normal ",{"tag":"a","children":["Battle Armor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Battle_Armor","referenceId":"reference:ba57c05b399c4316"}," into the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dark Armor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dark_Armor","referenceId":"reference:bc9b02500e8a7ac1"}," worn by ",{"tag":"a","children":["Sith Lords"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sith_Lords"},". You must have a suit of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Battle Armor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Battle_Armor","referenceId":"reference:ba57c05b399c4316"}," to transform into the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dark Armor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dark_Armor","referenceId":"reference:bc9b02500e8a7ac1"}," (",{"tag":"a","children":["Light Battle Armor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Light_Battle_Armor","referenceId":"reference:04e4cdde58e3988b"}," becomes ",{"tag":"a","children":["Light Dark Armor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Light_Dark_Armor","referenceId":"reference:39f9541a0d542dc0"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Battle Armor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Battle_Armor","referenceId":"reference:ba57c05b399c4316"}," becomes ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dark Armor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dark_Armor","referenceId":"reference:bc9b02500e8a7ac1"},", and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Heavy Battle Armor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Heavy_Battle_Armor","referenceId":"reference:9a339b9020a0ac53"}," becomes ",{"tag":"a","children":["Heavy Dark Armor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Heavy_Dark_Armor","referenceId":"reference:4ebe001d2c85d006"},"). The transformation process takes 1 day for ",{"tag":"a","children":["Light Dark Armor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Light_Dark_Armor","referenceId":"reference:39f9541a0d542dc0"},", 2 days for ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dark Armor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dark_Armor","referenceId":"reference:bc9b02500e8a7ac1"},", and 3 days for ",{"tag":"a","children":["Heavy Dark Armor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Heavy_Dark_Armor","referenceId":"reference:4ebe001d2c85d006"},". You must spend a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," at the end of the creation process to complete the armor's transformation."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Create Sith Talisman:"]}," You can spend a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," to imbue a portable object with ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Dark Side"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Dark_Side"},", creating a Sith Talisman that provides offensive strength to a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Power"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Power"},". Creating the Sith Talisman takes a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Full-Round Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Full-Round_Action"},". While you wear or carry the Sith Talisman on your person, you add 1d6 to your damage with ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Powers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Powers","referenceId":"reference:85acec94cd1ca5f3"},". You increase your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dark Side Score"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dark_Side_Score"}," by 1 when you first wear or carry a Sith Talisman. You can have only one Sith Talisman active at any given time, and if it is destroyed, you cannot create another one for 24 hours."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Create Sith Weapon:"]}," You can alchemically treat a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Simple Weapon (Melee)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Simple_Weapon_(Melee)"}," or an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Advanced Melee Weapon"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Advanced_Melee_Weapon"},", turning it into a Sith Weapon. You must spend a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," and spend 1 hour imbuing the weapon with the properties of a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Sith Alchemical Weapon"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sith_Alchemical_Weapon"},". A ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"}," does not ignore the Sith Weapon's DR, and characters who are proficient in the weapon's use can treat it as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"}," for the purposes of the ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Block"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Block"}]},", ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Deflect"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Deflect"}]},", and ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Redirect Shot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Redirect_Shot"}]}," Talents (and any ",{"tag":"a","children":["Talents"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Talents","referenceId":"reference:e8871b70ebfa07d9"}," that have these Talents as a prerequisite).\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":["Additionally, as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"},", the wielder of a Sith Weapon can spend a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," to gain a bonus equal to their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dark Side Score"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dark_Side_Score"}," to the damage of their next attack made with the weapon before the end of the encounter. This increases the wielder's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dark Side Score"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dark_Side_Score"}," by 1."]}]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Sith Alchemy Specialist"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Sith Advanced Alchemy"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You can modify an object with Sith Alchemy so that it gains a specific trait. Specific traits are listed in the Sith Alchemy table, below. You can only perform one modification at a time. Unless otherwise noted, you cannot grant more than one benefit to a single object, and you cannot apply the same benefit more than once. You must spend a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," and devote 1 hour of uninterrupted work to apply a trait to the relevant object, and when you do so, you increase your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dark Side Score"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dark_Side_Score"}," by 1.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"caption","children":["Sith Alchemy\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["DARK ARMOR TRAIT\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["EFFECT\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Cortosis Weave\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Automatically deactivates any ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsabers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsabers","referenceId":"reference:420c60d0a682943a"}," that strike the wearer.\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Dark Side Energy\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Grants the wearer a +2 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Equipment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Equipment","referenceId":"reference:7f2465ac7cefab27"}," bonus on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," checks made to activate ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Powers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Powers","referenceId":"reference:85acec94cd1ca5f3"}," with the [",{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Dark Side"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dark_Side"}]},"] descriptor.\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Dark Side Stealth\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Grants the wearer a +2 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Equipment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Equipment","referenceId":"reference:7f2465ac7cefab27"}," bonus on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," checks made to avoid detection.\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Imposing Form\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Grants the wearer a +2 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Equipment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Equipment","referenceId":"reference:7f2465ac7cefab27"}," bonus on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Persuasion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Persuasion","referenceId":"reference:196fbdc5f1823320"}," checks made to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Intimidate"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Intimidate"},".\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["SITH WEAPON TRAIT\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["EFFECT\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Jagged Weapon\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Any time the Sith Weapon damages a living creature, that creature takes 1d4 points of damage at the start of its next turn.\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Master's Weapon\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["The Sith Weapon grants a +2 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Equipment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Equipment","referenceId":"reference:7f2465ac7cefab27"}," bonus on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," checks to use the ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Block"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Block"}]}," and ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Deflect"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Deflect"}]}," Talents.\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Vile Weapon\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["The Sith Weapon is always considered to be laced with ",{"tag":"a","children":["Sith Poison"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sith_Poison","referenceId":"reference:1df10abcb4cabdab"},".\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["SITH ABOMINATION TRAIT\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["EFFECT\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Damage Reduction\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["The Sith Abomination gains ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Reduction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage_Reduction"}," 5, or increases its existing DR by +5.\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Iron Will\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["The Sith Abomination gains a +2 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Equipment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Equipment","referenceId":"reference:7f2465ac7cefab27"}," bonus to its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Will Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Will_Defense"},".\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Vile Natural Weapons\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["The Sith Abomination's Natural Weapons are laced with ",{"tag":"a","children":["Sith Poison"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sith_Poison","referenceId":"reference:1df10abcb4cabdab"},".\n"]}]}]}]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
